        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>文明驾驶题 52-60</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 15px 60px 15px;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .watermark-layer {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .watermark-layer span {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: rgba(150,150,150,0.18);\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    transform: rotate(-30deg);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .item-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .line {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #d43c2c;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 0;\n  }\n  .footer-marks {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .footer-left {\n    left: 15px;\n  }\n  .footer-right {\n    right: 15px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"watermark-layer\">\n  <span style=\"top:5%; left:10%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:15%; left:60%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:28%; left:20%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:40%; left:65%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:52%; left:15%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:64%; left:60%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:76%; left:20%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n  <span style=\"top:88%; left:65%;\">驾考宝典</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">52:【文明驾驶题】</span>题目中有\"依次\"，答对。选择题：选项中有依次，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">53:【文明驾驶题】</span>\"减速\"跟\"确认安全\" √ \"应当\" √ 应当+两年✓</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：题目中有确认安全，答对。选择题：选项中一个确认安全直接选，两个确认安全选带减速或减速选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">54:【文明驾驶题】</span>判断题：凡是见到判断题里有\"\"(双引号)的就答✓</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：题目中有礼让，答对。选择题：选项中有礼让，直接选。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：题目中有避免，答对。不避免，答错。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：题目中有主动，答对。选择题：选项中有主动，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">55:【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:减速、靠右依次</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：题目中有减速、靠右或减速，减速，答对。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">选择题：选项中有减速或靠右，减速，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">56:【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:减速、停车</span> 选择题：选项中减速、停车，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">57:【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:安全距离</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">选择题：选项中有一个安全距离直接选，两个安全距离选带大字的。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">关键词:加速</span> 判断题：题目中有加速，答错(加速过急除外)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">58:【违法行为】</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">判断题：违法行为，答✓，没有违法答×违章行为，答×</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">选择题：题目中问属于什么行为?直接选违法行为</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">问\"几种违法行为\"选\"三种违法行为\"</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">关键词:可可选不、可可选非、未未未选其他。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">59:【新能源/电动】</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">题目见电动汽车答✓，同时出现无需，频繁刹车答×</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"item-title\">60:【急救伤员题】</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line\">看到<span class=\"red\">【中毒】</span>要撤离，转移，原地等待不是救援，是原地等死。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【途经】</span>首先要检查是否有呼吸脉搏</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【骨折】</span>不要移动，用三角巾固定2-3-4人平移硬担架</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【失血】</span>先止血，止血从源头止，近心端动脉</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【全身烧伤】</span>清冷水灭火</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【烧伤口渴】</span>可喝淡盐水，只喝白开水100度答×</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【烧伤起泡】</span>用保鲜膜覆盖，避免感染</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【包扎】</span>不能用麻绳，错误选项，选麻绳。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">【昏迷伤】</span>员搬运需侧卧，仰防分泌物误入气管，会有窒息危险</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer-marks footer-left\">01178</div>\n<div class=\"footer-marks footer-right\">小红书号:3859943375</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
